          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefu abwira bene se n'inzu ya se ati “Ndagenda mbwire Farawo, yuko bene data n'inzu ya data bari mu gihugu cy'i Kanāni bansanze, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi ko ari abashumba kuko baragira amatungo, kandi ko bazanye imikumbi yabo n'amashyo yabo, n'ibyo bafite byose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Farawo nabahamagaza akababaza ati ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Umwuga wanyu ni umuki?’ Muzamusubize muti ‘Abagaragu bawe turagira amatungo, twahereye mu buto bwacu tugeza n'ubu, twebwe ubwacu na ba sogokuruza.’ Muvugire mutyo kugira ngo muture mu gihugu cy'i Gosheni, kuko umushumba wese ari ikizira ku Banyegiputa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.34"
            ]
          }
